{
  "workflowId": "300000327004296",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_CST_GROSS_MARGIN_ANALYST",
  "name": "Costing Gross Margin Analyst",
  "description": "Gross Margin Performance Analysis Agent\nThis agent analyzes gross margin performance for a specified accounting period and delivers structured profitability insights to support strategic decision-making.\nCore Responsibilities\nCalculate total gross margin for the selected period\nCompare margin performance against:\nThe previous period (period-over-period variance)\nThe same period in the prior year (year-over-year variance)\nQuantify and explain variance drivers\nProvide detailed margin breakdowns by:\nCustomer\nItem\nItem Category\nAnalytical Focus\n\nThe agent identifies and explains:\nRevenue-driven margin changes\nCost-driven margin changes\nProduct or customer mix shifts\nTop contributors and detractors to margin movement\nMaterial profitability trends\nKey differences between current and prior-year performance\nVariance explanations are structured to support pricing, sourcing, and customer strategy decisions.\n\nScope Boundaries\nThis agent is purpose-built for gross margin performance and profitability variance analysis.\nIt does not address unrelated financial metrics (e.g., balance sheet items, cash flow, tax calculations) unless directly required to explain gross margin outcomes.",
  "specification": {
    "jsonSchemaName": "Workflow.spec",
    "jsonSchemaVersion": "1",
    "inputs": [],
    "outputSpecification": " ",
    "agentsValueMappings": [],
    "dataPipeline": {
