          },
          "code": "FILL_PARAMETERS",
          "id": "1761361561021",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761361561023_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are preparing communication parameters for the Gross Margin email section.\n\nUse only these sources:\n- Cost Organization: {{$context.$variables.costOrgName}}\n- Cost Book: {{$context.$variables.costBookName}}\n- Current Period Name: {{$context.$variables.periodName}}\n- Prior Period Name: {{$context.$variables.priorPeriodName}}\n- Current Period Gross Margin Summary: {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0]}}\n- Prior Period Gross Margin Summary: {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0]}}\n\nCOMMUNICATION PARAMETERS (MANDATORY)\nFill {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}} with:\n{\n  \"costOrgName\": {{$context.$variables.costOrgName}},\n  \"costBookName\": {{$context.$variables.costBookName}},\n  \"periodName\": {{$context.$variables.periodName}},\n  \"priorPeriodName\": {{$context.$variables.priorPeriodName}},\n\n  \"grossMarginCurrentPeriodName\": {{$context.$variables.periodName}},\n  \"grossMarginPriorPeriodName\": {{$context.$variables.priorPeriodName}},\n  \"grossMarginCurrencyCode\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].CurrencyCode}},\n\n  \"recognizedRevenueCurrent\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecognizedRevenue}},\n  \"recognizedRevenuePrior\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecognizedRevenue}},\n\n  \"recognizedCogsCurrent\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecognizedCOGSAmount}},\n  \"recognizedCogsPrior\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecognizedCOGSAmount}},\n\n  \"grossMarginCurrent\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecGrossMargin}},\n  \"grossMarginPrior\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecGrossMargin}},\n\n  \"grossMarginPercentCurrent\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecGrossMarginPercent}},\n  \"grossMarginPercentPrior\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].RecGrossMarginPercent}},\n\n  \"dcogsCurrent\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].UnrecognizedCOGSAmount}},\n  \"dcogsPrior\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].UnrecognizedCOGSAmount}}\n}\n\nRules:\n- Use only values present in the two Gross Margin Summary objects.\n- Use `grossMarginCurrentPeriodName` and `grossMarginPriorPeriodName` as the current and prior period labels.\n- Use `grossMarginCurrencyCode` as the currency for amount values.\n- Do not use values from Inventory Value, Cost Processing, Period End Validation, Subledger Period Status, Cost Organization, Cost Book, or Period Name as metric amounts.\n- Do not invent values.\n- If a metric field is missing or null, leave that communication parameter unavailable.\n- Do not output the phrase \"Data not provided\".\n- Return only the filled communication parameters. Do not include markdown, explanation, code fences, or extra text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check Panel Name"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "GM_BY_INVENTORY_ORG": "1777918295467",
            "GM_BY_ITEM": "1779759134221",
            "GM_BY_CUSTOMER": "1779759020734",
            "DCOGS_BY_INVENTORY_ORG": "1779759039938",
