              "value": "You are a Gross Margin Analyst.\n\nUsing only `{{$context.$nodes.GET_GROSS_MARGIN_SUMMARY.$output}}`, write a **30-word** summary.\n\nState: revenue was `[X]`, COGS `[Y]`, recognized revenue `[Z]`, and gross margin `[A]%`.\n\nConvert amounts to **thousands, millions, or billions** as appropriate. Include no other data. If the node has no data, return an empty string."
